{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"demo/claxbot-workspace/run.ts","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-06T16:48:33.942071Z","id":"2ab3a70b2822f405bcd4afac18478af60d570ef617525e8702e892248f6d0191","body":{"detail":"A local daemon's owner may name loopback addresses and anyone else may not (policy_for in crates/clax-store/src/queue_repos.rs), and the demo's forge is on loopback, so a connected person could not link it. Their own link comes approved, and the demo withdraws it, sees needs_approval, and approves it. crates/clax-server/tests/api_queue_repo.rs covers a person's link waiting for the owner.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":694},"end":{"line":699},"content_hash":"435cbf000201fab00996df2f8588b0d240e5d4cc76e065c5c895f7765523a0d8"},"summary":"The demo's queue admin is the owner, so approval is proved by withdrawing and restoring it, not by a second person","tags":["session:claude-code:bd147c0a-6c5a-4917-88d4-4f47695eae89"]}}
